{'symbol': 'ORLY', 'date': '2021-11-17 16:30:00', 'title': "O'REILLY AUTOMOTIVE, INC. APPOINTS FRED WHITFIELD TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS", 'text': "SPRINGFIELD, MO., NOV. 17, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- O'REILLY AUTOMOTIVE, INC. (THE “COMPANY” OR “O'REILLY”) ( NASDAQ: ORLY), A LEADING RETAILER IN THE AUTOMOTIVE AFTERMARKET INDUSTRY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ADDITION OF FRED WHITFIELD TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS (THE “BOARD”), EXPANDING THE TOTAL NUMBER OF BOARD MEMBERS TO 10, WITH SEVEN MEMBERS DESIGNATED AS INDEPENDENT DIRECTORS UNDER THE NASDAQ STOCK MARKET RULES."}